let currentShareIndex=0;function audienceTheme(audience,quote=''){const female=/妈妈|女性|宝妈|女孩/.test(audience),professional=/职场|管理|创业|老板/.test(audience),young=/孩子|学生|青少年/.test(audience);let mood=/苦难|困境|韧性|命运|崩溃|失去|活着/.test(quote)?'resilience':/家人|家庭|关系|彼此|照顾|爱/.test(quote)?'connection':/工作|职场|行动|目标|成长/.test(quote)?'growth':'calm';const palettes={resilience:female?['#2f4148','#d58b72','#f5e7d8','#17272e']:['#263b3f','#b9724f','#eee0c8','#15262a'],connection:['#7f3f3f','#d9a38f','#f8eee4','#542b2b'],growth:professional?['#203744','#c69a54','#edf0ec','#122631']:['#345248','#d3a65d','#f3ead7','#213a33'],calm:young?['#47705a','#e8b85b','#f7f2d8','#294838']:['#425a50','#b86d51','#f1e7d7','#273c35']};const names={resilience:'沉静力量风',connection:'温暖关系风',growth:'理性成长风',calm:'安静治愈风'};return{name:names[mood],mood,colors:palettes[mood]}}
function drawSemanticBackground(ctx,theme,index){const [deep,warm,paper,ink]=theme.colors;const g=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,1080,1440);g.addColorStop(0,deep);g.addColorStop(.58,ink);g.addColorStop(1,warm);ctx.fillStyle=g;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1080,1440);ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=.22;if(theme.mood==='resilience'){ctx.fillStyle=warm;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(820,315,178,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle=paper;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,1080);ctx.lineTo(390,650);ctx.lineTo(610,955);ctx.lineTo(820,705);ctx.lineTo(1080,1010);ctx.lineTo(1080,1440);ctx.lineTo(0,1440);ctx.fill()}else if(theme.mood==='connection'){for(let i=0;i<4;i++){ctx.strokeStyle=i%2?paper:warm;ctx.lineWidth=38-i*6;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(540,630,180+i*105,.15,Math.PI*1.82);ctx.stroke()}}else if(theme.mood==='growth'){ctx.strokeStyle=warm;ctx.lineWidth=12;for(let i=0;i<6;i++){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(95+i*165,1160);ctx.lineTo(320+i*128,300-i*22);ctx.stroke()}ctx.fillStyle=paper;ctx.fillRect(760,160,190,260)}else{ctx.fillStyle=paper;for(let i=0;i<7;i++){ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(160+i*150,250+(i%3)*160,48+i*7,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill()}}ctx.globalAlpha=.08;ctx.fillStyle='#fff';for(let i=0;i<18;i++)ctx.fillRect((i*173+index*61)%1080,(i*257+index*97)%1440,2,2);ctx.restore()}
function generateQuoteImage(index){currentShareIndex=index;const canvas=$('#quoteCanvas'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),item=quoteSeeds[index],quote=item.text,book=$('#book').value.trim(),audience=$('#audience').value.trim(),theme=audienceTheme(audience,quote),paper=theme.colors[2],warm=theme.colors[1];drawSemanticBackground(ctx,theme,index);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(12,22,23,.38)';ctx.fillRect(70,70,940,1300);ctx.strokeStyle=warm;ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.strokeRect(70,70,940,1300);ctx.fillStyle=paper;ctx.font='700 29px "Microsoft YaHei"';ctx.fillText('真读 · READ FOR REAL',120,152);ctx.fillStyle=warm;ctx.font='600 23px "Microsoft YaHei"';ctx.fillText(`${theme.name}  /  ${String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}`,120,205);ctx.font='900 170px Georgia';ctx.globalAlpha=.18;ctx.fillText('“',105,430);ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.fillStyle=paper;ctx.font=`700 ${quote.length>34?54:quote.length>24?60:66}px "Microsoft YaHei"`;drawWrappedText(ctx,quote,130,475,820,92);ctx.fillStyle=warm;ctx.fillRect(130,1060,96,7);ctx.fillStyle=paper;ctx.font='600 31px "Microsoft YaHei"';ctx.fillText(`《${book}》原文摘录`,130,1140);ctx.font='400 27px "Microsoft YaHei"';ctx.fillText(`${item.location} · 写给 ${audience}`,130,1200);ctx.font='400 21px "Microsoft YaHei"';ctx.globalAlpha=.68;ctx.fillText('摘自用户上传文档 · 请结合所持版本核对页码',130,1300);ctx.globalAlpha=1;$('#shareStyleNote').textContent=`原文位置：${item.location} · 已匹配${theme.name} · 1080 × 1440`;$('#shareImageDialog').showModal()}
function drawWrappedText(ctx,text,x,y,maxWidth,lineHeight){const chars=[...text];let line='';let cursorY=y;for(const char of chars){const test=line+char;if(ctx.measureText(test).width>maxWidth&&line){ctx.fillText(line,x,cursorY);line=char;cursorY+=lineHeight}else line=test}if(line)ctx.fillText(line,x,cursorY)}
$('.share-close').onclick=()=>$('#shareImageDialog').close();$('#downloadImageBtn').onclick=()=>{$('#quoteCanvas').toBlob(blob=>{const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=`真读-金句${currentShareIndex+1}.png`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000);toast('高清分享图已下载')},'image/png')};
$('.close').onclick=()=>$('#detail').close();$('#copyBtn').onclick=async()=>{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(`${selected.title}\n${selected.insight}\n${selected.action}\n${selected.quote}`);toast('选题已复制')};$('#caseNavBtn').onclick=()=>$('#cases').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});$('#historyBtn').onclick=()=>{renderHistoryDialog();$('#historyDialog').showModal()};$('#historyCloseBtn').onclick=()=>$('#historyDialog').close();const myMenu=$('.my-menu'),myMenuBtn=$('#myMenuBtn'),myMenuPanel=$('#myMenuPanel'),authMenuAction=$('#authMenuAction'),loggedIn=!!window.trueReadCurrentUser();authMenuAction.textContent=loggedIn?'退出':'登录';myMenuBtn.onclick=e=>{e.stopPropagation();const open=myMenuPanel.hidden;myMenuPanel.hidden=!open;myMenu.classList.toggle('open',open);myMenuBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open))};myMenuPanel.onclick=e=>e.stopPropagation();document.addEventListener('click',()=>{myMenuPanel.hidden=true;myMenu.classList.remove('open');myMenuBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')});authMenuAction.onclick=()=>loggedIn?window.trueReadLogout():location.assign('login.html?next=index.html');
